### Readings Service API Tests

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8083/health

### Create Reading
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscriber_id": 1,
  "counter_id": 1,
  "value": 123.45,
  "reading_date": "2024-01-15"
}

### List Readings (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/readings?page=1&limit=20

### List Readings with filters
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/readings?subscriber_id=1&counter_id=1

### Get Reading by ID
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/readings/1

### Get Latest Readings
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/readings/latest?subscriber_id=1

### Get Latest Reading by Counter
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/counters/1/readings/latest

### Get Latest Readings by Subscriber
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/subscribers/1/readings/latest

### Get Monthly Readings
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/readings/monthly?subscriber_id=1&months=6

### Get Statistics
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/counters/1/readings/statistics?subscriber_id=1

### Update Reading
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/v1/readings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 130.00,
  "verified": true
}

### Verify Reading
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/readings/1/verify
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### Delete Reading
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/v1/readings/1
